WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:05.400
Long, long ago, Allah created Adam, the father of all humans, from clay.

2
00:00:05.800 --> 00:00:10.240
Allah breathed a soul into him. Adam opened his eyes and woke up.

3
00:00:10.640 --> 00:00:16.328
Allah told the angels to bow to Adam. They all bowed, except proud Iblis, who refused.

4
00:00:16.728 --> 00:00:23.688
Adam and his wife Hawa lived happily in Paradise. Allah said, Only that tree, do not go near it.

5
00:00:24.088 --> 00:00:29.440
Shaytan whispered to them, and they ate from the forbidden tree. They made a mistake.

6
00:00:29.840 --> 00:00:36.968
Right away they felt sorry, and prayed with all their hearts, Our Lord, we have wronged ourselves. Please forgive us.

7
00:00:37.368 --> 00:00:45.816
Allah accepted their repentance. Remember: when you make a mistake, turn back to Allah sincerely. He is the Most Forgiving, the Most Merciful.
